# Stack: Go gRPC

Package choices only. Trees and protobuf *placement* live in `go-core` / `backend-go-grpc-architecture-patterns` / `monorepo-architecture`. Attach with the Go gRPC preset.

| Concern | Choice | Notes / fallback |
|---------|--------|------------------|
| gRPC | google.golang.org/grpc | Generated APIs from monorepo `protobuf/` |
| Protobuf runtime | google.golang.org/protobuf | Do not hand-edit `*.pb.go` |
| Proto lint/generate | buf | `buf lint` / `buf generate`; optional `buf breaking` in CI |
| L2 tests | bufconn or in-process server | Assert status codes and contracts |
| SQL driver | pgx/v5 via `database/sql` | When SQL is used; see also `stack-go-http` SQL rows |
| SQL codegen | sqlc | Do not hand-edit generated output |
| Migrations | golang-migrate | When SQL is used |
| Tests | testify | |
| Lint | golangci-lint | When set up |
| Logging | `log/slog` | No Wire / zerolog on new services |
